  "summary_text": "Northwind Teams launch\nLaunch slips from Oct 28 to Nov 11 (SSO token expiry blocker)\nNext steps and support load and budget\nNext steps is the easy part\nConcern with support load: the dependencies on other teams\nBudget is mostly fine\nPreference to make it someone's job rather than agree on what done means\nSpreadsheet and positioning and team structure\nSpreadsheet: nobody's really touched it in a while\nSpreadsheet is the scary part\nSuggestion to simplify it before touching positioning\nTeam structure and narrative for the next raise seen as one underlying problem\nPreference to check with legal rather than just ship the smaller version\nHandoff and edge cases and hiring plan\nNo clear owner for handoff\nEdge cases is a bit of a black box\nSuggestion to map out the edge cases before touching hiring plan",
  "summary_markdown": "### Northwind Teams launch\n- Launch slips from Oct 28 to Nov 11 (SSO token expiry blocker)\n\n### Next steps and support load and budget\n- Next steps is the easy part\n- Concern with support load: the dependencies on other teams\n- Budget is mostly fine\n- Preference to make it someone's job rather than agree on what done means\n\n### Spreadsheet and positioning and team structure\n- Spreadsheet: nobody's really touched it in a while\n  - Spreadsheet is the scary part\n- Suggestion to simplify it before touching positioning\n- Team structure and narrative for the next raise seen as one underlying problem\n- Preference to check with legal rather than just ship the smaller version\n\n### Handoff and edge cases and hiring plan\n- No clear owner for handoff\n- Edge cases is a bit of a black box\n- Suggestion to map out the edge cases before touching hiring plan",
  "private_notes_text": null,
  "private_notes_markdown": null,
