      },
      "text": "Oh, my worry with the support load is the dependencies like on other teams. Which, I think the budget is mostly fine and the operating cadence is a little behind, so maybe clean up the backlog. Oh, we've been saying we'd write it down for a while, more or less. But the annoying thing about the feedback is like it's like the obvious next thing. I think the board update is a nice too have and the Slack thread is the blocker, so maybe start with the boring version. There's a world where we do a proper write-up and the notes from last time just goes away. Oh, I think the offsite agenda is still pretty rough and and the ownership question is not where I'd want it, so maybe park it for now. Anyway, honestly the sales pipeline only needs like fifteen calls if we test it with a few users.",
