      "end_time": "2026-10-14T11:05:12.829000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Elena Petrova"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, I wouldn't block on the competitive landscape, to be honest.",
