      "text": "Honestly, the design team mentioned the roadmap tradeoffs over the weekend, so it's on people's radar. Um, how did the requirements go? And should we just start with like boring version? Sorry, that's basically what we saw like with the doc on the team plan. And then are we worried about the offsite agenda? It's like, the spreadsheet is the scary part and nobody wants to say it.",
