      "end_time": "2026-10-14T11:07:12.483000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Yusuf Demir"
      },
      "text": "On Northwind Teams, the docs don't match match reality, I don't know. And then I don't know if the timeline is really the issue, kind of. Anyway, the short version is the sales pipeline is in good shape and stuff. So part of me wants to split it into two pieces, part of me thinks it's a little behind. Plus the like ownership question came up before this call too, but yeah. Also, the thing I'd push on is the hiring plan, right.",
